# Write the memo in HTML. Use <h2> for each section heading, <ul> and <li> for lists, and <strong> for field labels. Output only the HTML body — no <html>, <head>, <body>, or markdown fences.
Produce these sections:
<h2>Applicant & Facility Summary</h2> — name, borrower type, loan amount, security type.
<h2>Financial Position</h2> — state declared and verified revenue exactly as given above; never round or alter a figure. Where they differ, state both and flag the difference as an item for review.
<h2>Policy Compliance Evidence</h2> — for each applicable requirement in the policy (DSCR, ICR, eligibility, thresholds), state what the policy requires with its citation alongside the corresponding figure above. Present as a factual comparison for the analyst — do not conclude approve or decline.
